				},
				{
					"id": 721402302,
					"content": "好久不见啦！八酝岛外的世界怎么样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721402303,
					"content": "这里比家乡富裕很多，也有更多好吃的料理、好玩的东西。但是…我不太喜欢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长次"
				},
				{
					"id": 721402304,
					"content": "欸？为什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721402305,
					"content": "这里的人都缺少了些什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长次"
				},
				{
					"id": 721402306,
					"content": "从前在八酝岛生活的时候，大御所大人对我来说遥远安详…我们不会在意她在哪里，但是我们相信她就在这里，注视保护着我们，规定我们怎么过日子，成为什么样的人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长次"
				},
				{
					"id": 721402307,
					"content": "但是在这里，大御所大人覆盖一切，威压一切…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长次"
				},
				{
					"id": 721402308,
					"content": "唉，我也说不清楚啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长次"
				},
				{
					"id": 721402310,
					"content": "我们还在努力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721402309,
					"content": "对了，关于我的妈妈…你有发现什么吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721402310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "长次"
				},
				{
